{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/ff31ff740b389202fdf212f9444b7da3.poster.avif?t=1759967126\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/ff31ff740b389202fdf212f9444b7da3.webm?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/ff31ff740b389202fdf212f9444b7da3.mp4?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i></i></strong><br><br><i><strong>You saved the world. Now you just want to chop wood. But monsters don\u2019t retire, and neither can you.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tired of Being the Hero</i></strong> is a first-person dark fantasy RPG with a management twist and a deeper story about the choices we make. As a retired hero, experience retirement, get to know the local villagers, train peasants into warriors, raise morale, and stand together against monsters that refuse to let you fade into memory. Who would hold such a grudge against you anyways?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHATS IN THE DEMO?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This demo is a self-contained slice of <strong>Tired of Being the Hero</strong>, built to give you a real taste of the story and combat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cabin</strong> where you can chop wood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two combat</strong> <strong>maps</strong> featuring wave-based encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village hub</strong> where you can meet and talk with villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core combat systems</strong>: melee, spells, ranged attacks, and reflecting enemy projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early upgrade options</strong> to experiment with different playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will expand on this with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete <strong>narrative campaign</strong> that follows your journey as a retired adventurer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple regions and biomes</strong> beyond the demo maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wider skill tree with extra relics</strong>\u00a0giving you unique powers and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More villagers, more interactions</strong> and choices that shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression systems</strong> that grow across the entire game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More</strong> enemy types and bosses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/03f245de09bedc62beb58c77021f81b7.poster.avif?t=1759967126\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/03f245de09bedc62beb58c77021f81b7.webm?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/03f245de09bedc62beb58c77021f81b7.mp4?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><strong>Experience Retirement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay down your sword. Chop wood, haul wagons, and try to live as a simple villager with simple choices. But a hero\u2019s past doesn\u2019t stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/6fdfb534f7f1b539474cdcdd380e4a8f.poster.avif?t=1759967126\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/6fdfb534f7f1b539474cdcdd380e4a8f.webm?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/6fdfb534f7f1b539474cdcdd380e4a8f.mp4?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get To Know the Locals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or don't!</strong>  <br>You're tired after all and protecting them doesn't mean failure. Name them and motivate them to be heroes themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/76c4b7d3ac628a20df339477e07bae0a.poster.avif?t=1759967126\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/76c4b7d3ac628a20df339477e07bae0a.webm?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070050/extras/76c4b7d3ac628a20df339477e07bae0a.mp4?t=1759967126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Test Your Villagers Against Powerful Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do choose to coddle the weak...Help them defeat enemies to raise morale. Spend that morale to increase their level and power. Teach them new abilities, shift their roles, work together to survive the night.\u00a0<br><br><i>Thanks for giving it a shot, Hero.</i><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070050?t=1759967126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstat